# DIRECTIVE ZERO — AM-05 sshd_config
# SSH on 22. Key-only auth — players inject their key after SSTI foothold.

Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes

ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server